    "text": "Chriſt ( vvith his Aſſeſſors ) vvil iudge the vvhole vvorld, at the laſt day : in the meane time exhorteth ſinners to amend their life ; 7. for none ſhal eſcape iuſt iudgement. 11. The vvicked ſhal be puniſhed, and the good revvarded.",
