    { "line_index": 0, "verse": "73:14", "verse_number_printed": "14", "verse_marker": "†", "text": "14. † Thou haſt broken the heads of the dragon : thou haſt giuen" },
    { "line_index": 1, "verse": "73:14", "text": "him for meate to the peoples q of the Æthiopians.", "ref_letters_present": ["q"] },
    { "line_index": 2, "verse": "73:15", "verse_number_printed": "15", "verse_marker": "†", "text": "15. † Thou haſt r broken vp fountanes, and torrentes : thou haſt", "ref_letters_present": ["r"] },
    { "line_index": 3, "verse": "73:15", "text": "dried the riuers ſ of Ethan.", "ref_letters_present": ["ſ"] },
    { "line_index": 4, "verse": "73:16", "verse_number_printed": "16", "verse_marker": "†", "text": "16. † The day is thine, and the night is thine : thou haſt made the" },
    { "line_index": 5, "verse": "73:16", "text": "morning and the ſunne." },
    { "line_index": 6, "verse": "73:17", "verse_number_printed": "17", "verse_marker": "†", "text": "17. † Thou haſt made al the coaſts of the earth : the ſummer and" },
    { "line_index": 7, "verse": "73:17", "text": "the ſpring thou haſt formed them." },
    { "line_index": 8, "verse": "73:18", "verse_number_printed": "18", "verse_marker": "†", "text": "18. † Be mindeful of this, the enimie hath vpbraided our Lord :" },
    { "line_index": 9, "verse": "73:18", "text": "and a fooliſh people hath prouoked thy name." },
    { "line_index": 10, "verse": "73:19", "verse_number_printed": "19", "verse_marker": "†", "text": "19. † Deliuer not to beaſts the ſoules that confeſſe to thee : and" },
    { "line_index": 11, "verse": "73:19", "text": "the ſoules of thy poore forget not for euer." },
    { "line_index": 12, "verse": "73:20", "verse_number_printed": "20", "verse_marker": "†", "text": "20. † Haue reſpect vnto thy teſtament : becauſe they that are" },
    { "line_index": 13, "verse": "73:20", "text": "t obſcure of the earth, are filled with houſes of iniquities.", "ref_letters_present": ["t"] },
    { "line_index": 14, "verse": "73:21", "verse_number_printed": "21", "verse_marker": "†", "text": "21. † v Let not the humble be turned away being confounded :", "ref_letters_present": ["v"] },
    { "line_index": 15, "verse": "73:21", "text": "the poore and needy ſhal praiſe thy name." },
    { "line_index": 16, "verse": "73:22", "verse_number_printed": "22", "verse_marker": "†", "text": "22. † Ariſe God, iudge thy cauſe : be mindful of thoſe thy repro-", "line_end_hyphen": true },
    { "line_index": 17, "verse": "73:22", "text": "ches, that are w from the fooliſh man al the day.", "ref_letters_present": ["w"] },
    { "line_index": 18, "verse": "73:23", "verse_number_printed": "23", "verse_marker": "†", "text": "23. † x Forget not the voices of thine enimies : the y pride of", "ref_letters_present": ["x","y"] },
