  "apparatus": [
    { "role": "annotation", "ref_letter": "q", "anchor_verse": "73:14", "position": "right_margin", "typeface": "italic-vv", "text": "of blacke diuels." },
    { "role": "annotation", "ref_letter": "r", "anchor_verse": "73:15", "typeface": "italic-vv", "text": "geuen vvater out of rockes," },
    { "role": "annotation", "ref_letter": "ſ", "anchor_verse": "73:15", "typeface": "italic-vv", "text": "made paſſage ouer Iordañ." },
    { "role": "annotation", "ref_letter": "t", "anchor_verse": "73:20", "typeface": "italic-vv", "text": "Ignorant, blind, and barbarous infidels, lodge al kindes of iniquitie in their conſciences." },
    { "role": "annotation", "ref_letter": "v", "anchor_verse": "73:21", "typeface": "italic-vv", "text": "and therfore it is vnmeete, that faithful people ſhould be in bondage vnder them." },
    { "role": "annotation", "ref_letter": "w", "anchor_verse": "73:22", "typeface": "italic-vv", "text": "Theſe fooliſh audacious men do continually blaſpheme al holie thinges." },
    { "role": "annotation", "ref_letter": "x,y", "anchor_verse": "73:23", "typeface": "italic-vv", "text": "Omite not to puniſh them, y ſeing they are obſtinate and obdurate in pride, and in hatred." },
    { "role": "annotation", "ref_letter": "a", "anchor_verse": "74:1", "typeface": "italic-vv", "text": "Either this vvas the beginning of a ſongue, to the tune vvherof this Pſalme vvas ſong; as ſome Hebrevv Rabbins teſtifie; or, as S. Auguſtin and other fathers explicate, the Septuagint do admoniſh vs, by occaſion of this Pſalme, not to faile in our hope, for that God vvil in no caſe violate his promiſe nor purpoſe, but vvil render to euerie one in the day of Iudgement, as they deſerue." }
